      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET TANTRUM (2) has missed the frame the last couple but was a Maiden winner three back (17.82) at this track over 300m. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Better than latest and can atone here. JUNKYARD JILL (8) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (17.66) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can feature with the right run. STICKY MANGO (4) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (20.30) in a Maiden at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Rates a winning chance on best. SOUTHERN NOMAD (6) is by Banjo Boy out of Firelight Lady making debut. Profiles well so pay to keep very safe.",
